          "role": "explain",
          "est_duration_s": 14.1,
          "specific": false,
          "hits": [],
          "narration": "The model is a mixture of experts, a company of specialists with a receptionist who wakes only the few each word needs. Speed comes from the few that wake. Memory comes from the whole company, because any specialist could be next."
